| `0.0.0.0` (implicit) | app.js:16 | Host | `process.env.HOST` | MEDIUM |
| `alice@example.com` | app.js:12 | Test Data | Config/Database | MEDIUM |
| `bob@example.com` | app.js:13 | Test Data | Config/Database | MEDIUM |
| `production` (in DB URL) | .env.test | DB Name | `process.env.NODE_ENV` | HIGH |

