## Security Testing Checklist

### Automated Testing

```bash
# Dependency vulnerability scanning
npm audit
npm audit --audit-level=moderate

# Static code analysis
npm install --save-dev eslint-plugin-security
npx eslint . --ext .js

# Dynamic scanning (OWASP ZAP, Burp Suite)
# Can be integrated into CI/CD

# Dependency checking
npm outdated
npm list --depth=0
```

### Manual Testing

```bash
# Test security headers
curl -I https://your-app.com | grep -i "X-"

# Test CORS
curl -H "Origin: https://attacker.com" https://your-app.com/api

# Test rate limiting
for i in {1..150}; do curl https://your-app.com/api; done

# Test error handling
curl https://your-app.com/nonexistent

# Test input validation
curl -X POST https://your-app.com/api -d "$(python -c "print('x'*1000)")"
```

