## 6. ERROR HANDLING

### ❌ Original (app.js)
```javascript
app.get('/health', (req, res) => {
  res.json({ status: 'ok', timestamp: new Date().toISOString() });
});

app.get('/users', (req, res) => {
  res.json(users);
});

// No error handling!
// Unhandled errors crash or leak stack traces
// Sensitive info in error messages
```

**Vulnerabilities:**
