6. Implement comprehensive logging
7. Create `package.json` and run `npm audit`
8. Add error handling middleware
9. Configure CORS properly

### Long-term (Ongoing):
10. Implement HTTPS/TLS enforcement
11. Add request validation (joi, yup, express-validator)
12. Set up security monitoring/alerting
13. Regular dependency updates and scanning
14. Security testing (SAST, DAST, penetration testing)
15. Implement API authentication (JWT, OAuth2)

